        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“A horror RPG where monsters never die — survive, rescue victims, and escape the Folded World before your soul is lost forever.”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840590/extras/6cccc39a29dde7526d27f26bbb94595d.avif?t=1773330424\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Folded World, a distorted parallel universe where urban legends like Bloody Mary, Jiangshi, and the Backrooms hunt the lost. As an Agent, you have 49 minutes to rescue victims and break 7 mirrors that guarantee your exit. But beware: the monsters don’t die. Each death deducts 7 minutes from your time, and if you run out of time completely, your soul deteriorates and you become a shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your equipment strategically:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• Blaster — long-range attack with limited charges </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• Reaper — repels creatures and provides protection, but deals low damage </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• Amulet — healing and elemental damage, with limited charges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in mirrors or tall grass to recover sanity, plan routes, and conserve resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay loop and tension</strong> During exploration:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Weak enemies roam the maps • An immortal monster appears during Terror Hour • Every decision affects your time and sanity • Rescuing victims grants advantages and extends your survival • Combat is dangerous and strategic; often, fleeing is the best choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is challenging: every minute counts, and every mistake visibly affects your character’s appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840590/extras/346e7f0a877ffc47a7561c59299dc29f.avif?t=1773330424\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >85 adaptive maps with dynamic weather and unsettling music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Sanity affects damage dealt: above 90% you suffer penalties; 70–90% doubles damage • Over 100 skills and 50 items requiring strategic management • Dark story and pacts involving Lee, Nyx, and Seth • Mature themes: extreme violence, psychological torment, betrayal, sacrifice • Support for 5 languages: English, Portuguese, Chinese, Russian, and Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840590/extras/8e8e17475175bf80100e4e00621b873b.avif?t=1773330424\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Agents of Shadow is for adult audiences. The game contains extreme violence, psychological horror, difficult moral choices, and graphic horror elements. Survival depends on strategy, timing, and resource management.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“A horror RPG where monsters never die — survive, rescue victims, and escape the Folded World before your soul is lost forever.”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840590/extras/6cccc39a29dde7526d27f26bbb94595d.avif?t=1773330424\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Folded World, a distorted parallel universe where urban legends like Bloody Mary, Jiangshi, and the Backrooms hunt the lost. As an Agent, you have 49 minutes to rescue victims and break 7 mirrors that guarantee your exit. But beware: the monsters don’t die. Each death deducts 7 minutes from your time, and if you run out of time completely, your soul deteriorates and you become a shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your equipment strategically:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• Blaster — long-range attack with limited charges </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• Reaper — repels creatures and provides protection, but deals low damage </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >• Amulet — healing and elemental damage, with limited charges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in mirrors or tall grass to recover sanity, plan routes, and conserve resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay loop and tension</strong> During exploration:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Weak enemies roam the maps • An immortal monster appears during Terror Hour • Every decision affects your time and sanity • Rescuing victims grants advantages and extends your survival • Combat is dangerous and strategic; often, fleeing is the best choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is challenging: every minute counts, and every mistake visibly affects your character’s appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840590/extras/346e7f0a877ffc47a7561c59299dc29f.avif?t=1773330424\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >85 adaptive maps with dynamic weather and unsettling music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Sanity affects damage dealt: above 90% you suffer penalties; 70–90% doubles damage • Over 100 skills and 50 items requiring strategic management • Dark story and pacts involving Lee, Nyx, and Seth • Mature themes: extreme violence, psychological torment, betrayal, sacrifice • Support for 5 languages: English, Portuguese, Chinese, Russian, and Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840590/extras/8e8e17475175bf80100e4e00621b873b.avif?t=1773330424\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Agents of Shadow is for adult audiences. The game contains extreme violence, psychological horror, difficult moral choices, and graphic horror elements. Survival depends on strategy, timing, and resource management.</p>",
